  "Software Details": "Yazılım Detayları",
  "Introducing the Product Barcode Module of eCommerceGo SaaS, an essential tool for modern businesses looking to optimize their inventory management processes. With this module, businesses can effortlessly generate and scan product barcodes, streamlining inventory control and ensuring accurate tracking of stock levels. Seamlessly integrated into the eCommerce platform, the barcode module offers convenience and efficiency, allowing for smooth communication between inventory management and sales channels.": "Envanter yönetimi süreçlerini optimize etmek isteyen modern işletmeler için önemli bir araç olan eCommerceGo SaaS'ın Ürün Barkod Modülüyle tanışın. ",
