  "EffoSimplifying Inventory Management with Unique Barcodes": "EffoBenzersiz Barkodlarla Envanter Yönetimini Basitleştirme",
  "One of the key features of the Product Barcode Module is its ability to generate unique barcodes for each product in the inventory. This simplifies the identification and tracking of products, reducing errors and enhancing overall efficiency. Additionally, the module supports mobile scanning, enabling users to scan barcodes directly from their smartphones or tablets. This real-time scanning capability facilitates instant updates to inventory records, ensuring that businesses always have accurate information about their stock levels. You can also select the types and color of the barcode, that will be visible on the front end of your theme.": "Ürün Barkod Modülünün en önemli özelliklerinden biri stoktaki her ürüne özel barkod üretebilmesidir. ",
  "Enhancing Efficiency with Mobile Scanning Capabilities": "Mobil Tarama Özellikleriyle Verimliliği Artırma",
  "Efficient inventory control is crucial for any business, and the Product Barcode Module helps achieve this by providing comprehensive inventory management functionalities. Businesses can easily track product movement, monitor stock levels, and prevent stockouts by leveraging the module is capabilities. By maintaining accurate inventory records, businesses can minimize operational disruptions and ensure a seamless customer experience.": "Verimli envanter kontrolü her işletme için çok önemlidir ve Ürün Barkod Modülü, kapsamlı envanter yönetimi işlevleri sağlayarak bunun başarılmasına yardımcı olur. ",
  "Comprehensive Inventory Control Functionality": "Kapsamlı Envanter Kontrol İşlevselliği",
